# Google Maps Platform API Key for Vite Client
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and replace the placeholder with your key:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# Option A: Free Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key (Prototyping Only)
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card or Cloud project required).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms and click to generate/reveal the demo key.
# 4. Paste the key below in `.env.local`. (Daily reset limit; not for production.)
#
# Option B: Production Google Cloud API Key
# Enable these APIs in Google Cloud Console:
# - Maps JavaScript API (includes Street View & Geometry)
# - Places API (New)
# - Routes API
# Restrict your key by HTTP referrer (e.g. http://127.0.0.1:*, https://yourdomain.com/*)
# and restrict allowed APIs to only the three listed above.

VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
